WEBVTT

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.650
Toru...

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.030
Toru! Toru, wake! Toru!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.230
What is it?

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.980
Toru, look, look! Ahead!

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.460
What is that?

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.770
You don't know, Brother? 
That is called the ocean.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:01.390
It's your first time 
seeing it, too, isn't it?

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.740
Toru, Akari, see ocean, first time?

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.300
The village of Acura was in the mountains.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.100
My first time, too!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.220
Feels cool...

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.080
Too salty!

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.020
Sideways walk.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.030
Chaika!

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.150
It looks like big waves hit 
here sometimes, so be—

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.060
Toru, laugh! Mean!

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.220
Hey, stop that!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.310
Brother might look rather good all wet.

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.760
I'll help you, Chaika.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.980
You idiot! Cut it out!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.490
That displeased face is 
quite enticing, as well.

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:51.810
You impress me, Brother.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.230
I've just witnessed the quintessential 
master of dripping wet love scenes!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:55.980
Give it a res—

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.280
The Harbor of Phantom Dreams Recollected

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.610
This is the mansion of Clay Morgan, 
one of the eight heroes.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:09.500
Yeah.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.370
All we know about him is 
that he uses a spear.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.500
I hope he's someone who 
can understand reason.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.720
Chaika, what are you looking at?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.250
Claudia said... Father's fortune.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.640
Hidden island.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:32.000
Yeah, the rumor did say it was 
in the ocean around here...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:32.970
Yes.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.470
Hey, Chaika, you know the 
battle for the remains

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:39.160
is going to get tougher now, right?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.480
The red Chaika already got one of them 
and is a step ahead of us.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.990
Instead of talking about a fortune 
that we don't even know exists,

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:52.020
shouldn't we be trying to get more 
remains as quickly as we can?

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.250
Yes...

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:06.760
Sixty-four sheep...

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:12.760
What's going on?

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:16.670
Lots of people here, eh? 
And they're all uglier than me!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:21.050
Why are all these people lined up here?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.800
Clay Morgan loves to laugh,

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.460
so he has many entertainers 
perform for him every day.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.360
If we make him laugh, 
he gives us lots of money!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:33.220
A hero who likes comedy? That's different.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.940
In other words, we just have 
to look like entertainers.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.810
That Gundo could be trouble.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.880
Next!

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.500
Are you a ventriloquist?

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.590
Yep, that's right!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.790
You're the third ventriloquist today.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.890
We've seen enough. Go home!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.270
Looks like the screening is fairly strict.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.400
Yeah.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.860
Next!

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.260
And you are?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.720
We are a troupe of street performers.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.860
Street performers, eh? That's not unusual.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.430
Is there anything unique you can do?

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.160
Yes! Ah...

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.590
Of course.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:14.430
This man is a one-of-a-kind immortal.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.340
He can sit fully naked in 
a tub of boiling water,

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:20.570
impersonating a cockatrice while 
eating pasta through his nose.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.970
That sounds amazing!

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.320
Okay, go on in!

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.160
Did you have to say all that?

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.620
It got us inside, didn't it?

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.920
Toru, pasta through nose, amazing!

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:30.930
Don't take it seriously!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.580
I am Clay Morgan.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.690
Are you the man who can sit fully 
naked in a tub of boiling water,

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:40.310
impersonating a cockatrice while 
eating pasta through your nose?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.780
I'd love to see that. Show me.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.120
Clay Morgan, I'd like to talk to y—

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.820
Strip, Brother.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.320
What are you doing?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.420
You need to be naked to 
sit in boiling water.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.350
You just made all that up!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.620
Why do I actually have to do it?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.040
Because I want to see it.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:58.960
Who cares?!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.830
Do you hate me, Brother?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:05.990
Have you not sufficient kindness to 
grant your sweet sister's simple wish?

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:10.440
What's sweet about a sister who 
forces me to strip at knifepoint?!

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.960
Now that you've gotten my hopes up,

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.600
is it not your job as an older 
brother to live up to them?

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:17.150
You got your own hopes up!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.610
Toru! Want to see, too!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:19.810
You be quiet!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.400
So you're a critical comedian troupe 
in the guise of street performers!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.300
How novel! I like it!

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.950
Do come again sometime.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.450
You may take your money and go.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.760
Well, I guess that worked out...

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.280
We don't need the money.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:39.290
We want the remains instead.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.260
Emperor Gaz's remains.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.380
Wh-Who are you people?!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.880
The remains?!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.020
I feel ill.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:52.010
Leave! Leave now!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.390
Return Father's remains!

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.890
F-Father?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.730
Gaz's daughter, Chaika!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.180
You're...

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:05.810
That can't be! I saw... I saw you die!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.340
Your head rolled!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.600
It wasn't me! The one who killed you...

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.700
The one who cut off your head was Hartgen!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.650
Why are you here?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.660
Have you come to curse me?!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.450
Stay away! Stay away, ghost!

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.890
Stay away!

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.800
He ran away...

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.290
What was that about?

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.180
Toru! Clay, where?!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.460
He ran. We're going after him.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.800
You wait in the vehicle.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:40.900
I come with!

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:43.060
You can't run with your Gundo.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.010
Leave this one to us.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.400
Right...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.930
Fredrica?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.780
What are you guys doing here?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.120
Good timing! Look after Chaika!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.330
Huh?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.330
Master Morgan?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.830
He went running behind there 
like a madman not long ago.

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:07.040
He came in here earlier, 
and left through the back door.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.290
Find him?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.140
No. He seems to be running around with 
no concern for what others think.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:20.360
Looks like he won't be returning 
to his mansion for a while.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:21.930
Damn...

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.500
Fresh fish really is delicious!

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:33.960
Chaika, are you worried about 
the emperor's fortune?

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:35.320
Yes.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.690
But nobody ever found that island, right?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.600
Possible, entire island hidden, magic.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.790
Oh, that's true.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:48.440
Secret of Chaika... Information, desperate.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.770
Ship...

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.000
Fredrica! Request, stay here!

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:22.210
Stay away, you friend of that ghost!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.970
Get away! Get away!

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.120
What are you so afraid of?

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.080
Are you that scared of the 
emperor you took down yourself?

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.890
Someone who wasn't part of the 
fight wouldn't understand!

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:38.310
He was stabbed, cut apart, 
covered with blood... and he was smiling!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.330
As if he pitied us...

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.460
As if he were looking 
down on some insects...

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.860
He was no human. He was a monster!

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:53.520
You made me remember it all...

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.990
After I was finally enjoying life again!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.870
You've been summoning entertainers

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.490
to make you forget about Emperor Gaz?

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:03.370
Where is she? Where is his daughter's ghost?

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:08.250
The rumor that his dead daughter was 
searching for his remains was true?!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.450
Damn it! Disappear!

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:20.970
A secret island?

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.660
Never heard of it.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.210
Rumor, clue, anything! Please!

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:27.490
I'm not sure what to tell you...

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.730
I don't know if it has any connection,

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:33.510
but there is a place off the coast 
that people call the Evil Sea.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:35.230
Need details!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:40.590
All boats that go near there end 
up sinking or going missing.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.850
So none of the fishermen 
around here will go near it.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.870
There's no island there, though.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.740
Only ocean.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.770
Evil Sea...

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:13.150
Have you lost your mind, 
starting a fight in a place like this?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.860
Shut up!

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:18.990
Stay away!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.580
Don't let that girl come near me!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.420
Want to keep going?

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.420
If you want to kill me, go ahead!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.650
I don't want to kill you. 
All I want is the remains.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.220
Just the remains?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.800
Yes. Where are you hiding them?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.510
If I give you the remains, will you go away?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.110
Fine! You can have it!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:47.640
Just don't ever appear in front of me again!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.770
Any luck, Brother?

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.490
Yeah, it's here!

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:58.600
He was afraid to keep them anywhere 
near him, so he hid them here?

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.530
Why didn't he just sell them?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.950
There must be plenty of 
people who would want them.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.660
He probably thought he'd be 
cursed if he got rid of them.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:08.370
Okay, ready to head back?

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:13.510
You still love to show up 
out of nowhere, I see.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:17.590
In the coastal waters northeast 
of here, there is an island.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.630
That is where you should go next.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.510
An island? Where Emperor Gaz's fortune is?

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.830
You'll find out when you get there.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.060
Hold it!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.700
Guy, you knew that there were 
multiple Chaikas, didn't you?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.030
And here's a question for 
you: do you really believe

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:37.230
I'm the same Guy who spoke to you before?

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.610
You're not going to give us 
a straight answer, are you?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.160
You are free to think what you will.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:49.070
No matter how often I see it, 
I don't know how he does that.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:51.880
Yeah. I'd guess it's a form of magic, but...

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:55.920
He didn't say that what's on 
the island is more remains.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:00.170
If gathering remains is our priority, 
we should probably follow Claudia's note.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:03.230
Then we should head for the 
Principality of Hartgen?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:07.990
Its leader, Stephan Hartgen, 
was the leader of the punitive force.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:11.450
If what Claudia and Clay said is true,

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.640
then he's the man who cut off Chaika's head.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:20.050
Shin Acura, raise your head.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.100
Yes, sir.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.230
What is the status of the remains?

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:27.000
Yes, sir. A large number of remains

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.200
should soon arrive here in 
the Principality of Hartgen.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:32.930
They will arrive with the one who 
currently possesses the most remains,

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.560
the white Chaika.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.040
I see.

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.960
When all the remains are gathered,

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.400
you're going to show me first, right, Father?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.720
Hey, Arina, that's not fair.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.300
You're going to show me, aren't you, Father?

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:51.320
Irina, Arina... My daughters.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:55.390
Of course, I promise you two 
will be the first to see.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.060
The white Chaika, eh?

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:01.830
I understand her two saboteur employees 
are acquaintances of yours.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.070
Yes, somewhat.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.060
Three people who grew up as family,

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:08.170
taking up weapons to fight 
each other to the death...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.780
I look forward to it.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.470
I will have you do your 
job to the fullest, Shin.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.080
Yes, sir.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.500
And you, as well,

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.900
cavalier of lost honor.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.380
Fredrica, where's Chaika?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.130
Oh, she went off somewhere by herself.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.150
Where?!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.590
Please, sail ship!

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.800
Reward, lots!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.140
You've gotta be kidding! Anywhere but there!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.510
Pay bonus!

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:37.190
Even if you give me money, 
it's useless if I'm dead!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:39.960
Please! Someone, help!

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:42.940
Chaika!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.280
Toru...

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.450
What were you thinking?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.530
It's not just Clay.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.530
The red Chaika's group might be close by!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.430
What if a fight had broken out?

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.070
Selfish actions, apologize.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.080
But, serious.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.420
Father's fortune, myself... Want to know.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.750
That again?

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.510
Frankly, I'm against it.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.620
We have no idea what this fortune is,

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.390
and the information we have is too vague.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.090
Not to mention, if we know it's 
in such dangerous waters,

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:21.100
that's all the more reason 
not to approach carelessly.

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.440
Your objective is to gather 
the remains, right?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.650
We know where the remaining heroes are.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.760
Why can't you get all the remains first,

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.440
and then think about the fortune?

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.910
New facts, one after another.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.470
Many Chaikas. All created.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.540
My memories, missing.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.630
Everything, unclear.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.590
Want to know everything.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:52.340
But you don't know if you'll find anything 
out once you get his fortune...

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.350
Toru, can't understand my feelings!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.600
Will search for fortune!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.520
Even alone! Father's fortune!

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.550
Alone, you say?

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:07.270
In other words, you're firing us, then?

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.170
Saboteurs will risk their lives as 
tools to serve their master's purpose,

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.410
but once we're fired, that's it.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:15.980
Later.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:19.620
Toru...

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:26.360
No helping it now.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:31.590
Akari...

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:34.140
Aww, they left.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.260
You okay with that, Chaika?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.470
Said I would work alone.

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.770
Can't stop Toru.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.410
Yeah?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.380
I wonder what I should do...

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.280
I only followed you guys because 
I wanted to fight Toru.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:56.450
Fredrica, last favor! Just one!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.260
Want to find island.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.180
Dragoon, fly, Evil Sea!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.680
Oh, you want me to take 
you close to the island?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.540
Yes!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.920
Sure, just going there is fine.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.500
It sounds sort of interesting.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:12.210
Grateful!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.630
I guess we're camping here tonight.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:20.190
We'll think tomorrow about what 
we should do starting tomorrow.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:23.550
You never change, Brother.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.810
Ever since we lived in Acura...

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:29.580
I understand that you want to 
keep Chaika out of danger.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:31.900
What are you talking about?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.450
I was only following the 
law of the saboteur.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.110
Suppose you were to die, Brother.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:46.900
And suppose the many lewd, repulsive things

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:49.590
you owned were hidden on some island.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.710
What kind of supposition is that?

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.120
If that were the fortune 
you had left behind,

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:57.170
I would go to find them, 
even to the ends of the world.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.620
It's just the same as

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:04.050
the way Chaika values her father's 
remains as well as his fortune.

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:10.230
That being the case, shouldn't a 
saboteur respect his master's will?

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.010
You know how inept Chaika is.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:17.170
This very night, she may be off 
somewhere being raped by some thug.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.210
Or she may have fallen prey to some beast.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.860
Or she may have encountered 
the red Chaika's gang,

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.040
and her head has said 
farewell to her body...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.790
Okay, I get it!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.430
I'll go back and talk 
things out with Chaika.

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:31.290
Is that good enough?

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:35.700
I told you that I am only 
following you, Brother.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.790
She's trying to get to the island alone?!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.180
That idiot!

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.530
What's impossible is impossible.

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:53.140
Any kind of boat will do! 
As long as it will take us close!

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:54.420
Give it up.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:58.110
No fisherman around here 
will take a boat out there.

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:02.870
What about that boat? Whose is it?

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:06.210
Oh, that's Master Morgan's cargo ship.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:09.260
He runs the shipping industry 
around here, after all.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:14.960
Wh-What? What do you want now?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.550
We want to borrow your boat.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:21.680
If you don't want Emperor Gaz's remains 
scattered all around this house...

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.290
Okay! I understand!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.890
I'll arrange it right away!

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.890
It's all so vague.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.320
We're supposed to go to an island 
nobody knows the location of?

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.400
What?

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.620
It's them!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.600
This doesn't look like a coincidence.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.320
Yeah. What should we do, Princess?

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.290
Efun... Heluste... Ru... 
Belguil... Fai... Sev...

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.540
Come, resounding perception.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.330
The Locator!

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:01.380
Reaction... faint...

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:04.050
Fredrica! Ahead, right!

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:15.400
It's fogging up.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.260
Hey! Get out here!

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:24.990
Well, well. Found us already?

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.440
I figured we'd run into you sometime.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:31.290
You guys heard the same 
information we did, didn't you?

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.710
Whatever do you mean?

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.130
White girl, where?!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.460
She had some things to do.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.660
So, what do you want to do?

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.550
It could be fun to fight it out right here.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.080
I don't want to sink to the bottom 
of the ocean with you guys.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:50.580
I especially don't want you putting 
a hole in this boat with your magic!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.980
That depends on what you do!

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.450
Ruler that controls...

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.150
Come, The Commander!

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:13.710
There! Found island!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:15.360
Want to land?

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:16.170
Yes!

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:21.650
Dragoons?

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.220
They look like it, 
but I don't think they are.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:32.270
What?!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:40.980
Kraken?!

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:47.200
Damn monster!

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.110
Father's fortune, on island?

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.550
Fredrica, moment before landing, crash!

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.650
Separated from her!

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:35.340
Here, where? Fortune, where?

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:37.290
Return safely, possible?

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:40.190
The Writhing Island

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.660
Next time: The Writhing Island.
